

Q1) What is the difference between authentication and authorization?  
  (Admin login यशस्वी होणे म्हणजे authentication. त्या admin ला job delete करण्याची permission आहे का, हे authorization.)

1.Authentication verifies a user's identity

2.authorization determines what that user is permitted to access    

Authentication	                                               Authorization
Who are you?	                                         What are you allowed to do?
Verifies identity	                                     Checks permissions
Example: user login	                                     Example: only admin can delete jobs

