Q5) What is Authorization?
********English answer:
“Authorization determines what an authenticated user is allowed to access or perform.”
मराठीत: Login झाल्यानंतर user ला कोणत्या गोष्टी करण्याची permission आहे, हे तपासणं.

उदाहरण:
- ROLE_USER — सामान्य user साठी परवानगी असलेली कामं.
- ROLE_ADMIN — admin-only कामं, जसं job delete करणे.

*********Counter-question: How do you implement authorization in Spring Boot?
Answer: “I can configure role-based access using Spring Security request authorization rules or method-level security annotations such as @PreAuthorize.”

*********उदाहरण:

@PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')")                                //ही फक्त उदाहरणार्थ controller method आहे
@DeleteMapping("/jobs/{id}")
public String deleteJob(@PathVariable Long id) {
    return "Job deleted";
}

