Q8. What is PasswordEncoder?

***English answer:
“PasswordEncoder is used to encode passwords and verify submitted passwords against stored password hashes. BCrypt is a commonly used password-hashing algorithm.”
मराठीत: Database मध्ये plain password ठेवण्याऐवजी password hash करून save करतो.

उदाहरण:
PasswordEncoder encoder =
        new BCryptPasswordEncoder();

String hashedPassword =
        encoder.encode("Jay@12345");

boolean matches =
        encoder.matches(
            "Jay@12345",
            hashedPassword
        );

*******Counter-question: Can we decrypt a BCrypt password?
Answer: “No. BCrypt is a one-way password-hashing algorithm. We verify a password using matches() rather than decrypting the stored hash.”    

